     <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title-ja">
      <p data-template-id="hero-kicker" class="canva-text eyebrow mb-8 text-[#a75743]" style="color: rgb(167, 87, 67); font-size: 12px;">A SMALL PAGE FOR TODAY</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title-ja" data-template-id="hero-title-ja" class="canva-text ja title mb-8 font-medium" style="color: rgb(41, 46, 42); font-weight: 500; font-size: 34px;">いま、ここにいる</h1>
      <h1 data-template-id="hero-title-en" class="canva-text en title mb-8 font-medium" style="color: rgb(41, 46, 42); font-weight: 500; font-size: 34px;">Being Here, Now</h1>
      <p data-template-id="hero-intro-ja" class="canva-text ja intro text-[#555b54]" style="color: rgb(85, 91, 84);">今日の自分は、どんな場所にいるのでしょう。答えを急がず、いまの景色や気持ちに、少しだけ目を向けてみませんか。</p>
      <p data-template-id="hero-intro-en" class="canva-text en intro text-[#555b54]" style="color: rgb(85, 91, 84);">Where do you find yourself today? There is no need to rush toward an answer. Take a moment to notice your surroundings and how you feel.</p>
      <div class="mt-10 max-w-3xl border-l-[3px] border-[#a75743] pl-5">
       <p data-template-id="not-ending-title-ja" class="canva-text ja font-semibold" style="color: rgb(41, 46, 42); font-weight: 600;">人生の栞はエンディングノートではありません。</p>
       <p data-template-id="not-ending-title-en" class="canva-text en font-semibold" style="color: rgb(41, 46, 42); font-weight: 600;">Life Bookmark is not an end-of-life notebook.</p>
       <p data-template-id="not-ending-copy-ja" class="canva-text ja copy mt-2" style="color: rgb(85, 91, 84);">死後の手続きや財産整理を記録するためのサービスではなく、今を生きる人が毎月、自分の現在やこれからを自分のペースで見つめるための通信型サービスです。</p>
       <p data-template-id="not-ending-copy-en" class="canva-text en copy mt-2" style="color: rgb(85, 91, 84);">It is not a service for recording posthumous arrangements or organizing assets. It is a monthly correspondence series for people living now to reflect on where they are and what may come next, at their own pace.</p>
      </div>
     </section>
     <section class="grid gap-12 py-16 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.35fr]" aria-label="Series / シリーズ">
      <div>
       <p data-template-id="series-kicker" class="canva-text section-label mb-5" style="color: rgb(167, 87, 67); font-size: 12px;">ABOUT THE SERIES</p>
       <h2 data-template-id="series-title-ja" class="canva-text ja font-medium leading-relaxed" style="color: rgb(41, 46, 42); font-weight: 500; font-size: 26px;">一冊にまとめなくていい。</h2>
       <h2 data-template-id="series-title-en" class="canva-text en font-medium leading-relaxed" style="color: rgb(41, 46, 42); font-weight: 500; font-size: 26px;">No need to fit a life into one book.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-5">
       <p data-template-id="series-copy-ja" class="canva-text ja copy" style="color: rgb(85, 91, 84);">「人生の栞」は、毎月ひとつのお題を届ける継続型のサブスクリプションサービスです。人生を一冊にまとめるのではなく、分冊で少しずつ、自分の人生の一片を残すシリーズです。</p>
       <p data-template-id="series-copy-en" class="canva-text en copy" style="color: rgb(85, 91, 84);">Life Bookmark is an ongoing subscription that delivers one prompt each month. Rather than gathering a whole life into one volume, this series offers small, separate installments in which to keep a piece of your story at a time.</p>
       <p data-template-id="series-pace-ja" class="canva-text ja copy" style="color: rgb(85, 91, 84);">届いた月に取り組んでも、ずっと後で開いても。順番も進め方もあなたの自由です。回答や記録の提出は不要です。</p>
